<title>USA: BEFORE THE BELL - Galoob, ADT surge.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL - Galoob, ADT surge.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of ADT Ltd and Galoob Toys Inc surged in pre-opening trading after ADT received a buyout bid from Western Resources Inc and toymaker Galoob forecast strong profits.</p>
<p>Shares of ADT surged to 23-3/4 after the bid was made this morning, traders said, above Western Resource's bid of $22.50 a share. The stock closed on the New York Stock Exchange on Tuesday at 20-1/8.</p>
<p>The $3.5 billion bid consists of $15 worth of Western common stock and $7.50 cash for each share of ADT.</p>
</text>
